1
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:06,840
No Matter What, the Earth Still Spins.

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:16,400
Long ago, people thought earth stood still in one place,

3
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:29,910
while sun, moon and stars revolve around earth.

4
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:50,970
Polish astronomer Copernicus rejected that wrong view.

5
00:00:50,970 --> 00:01:10,440
In 1543, Copernicus published a book proving that earth itself is a planet revolving around sun.

6
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:29,910
In 1632, astronomer Galileo wrote a book agreeing with Copernicus's view.

7
00:01:29,910 --> 00:01:41,510
Immediately, court decided to ban that book and brought Galileo to trial.

8
00:01:41,510 --> 00:01:49,220
At that time, scientist was nearly seventy years old.

9
00:01:49,220 --> 00:02:03,640
Regarded as criminal, old scientist was forced to swear to abandon view that earth revolves.

10
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:10,640
But just stepping out of court, he angrily said aloud:

11
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:17,350
No matter what, the earth still spins!

12
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:22,260
Finally, truth must win.

13
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:36,840
Thoughts of two brave scientists have become simple truth in daily life now.

